ld days regenerated as v2 now carry their REAL mechanic as code** (d25): d19 set = genuine `Class.forName` /\n  `getDeclaredMethod` / `Method.invoke` dispatch; d16 set = the u16 length-narrowing gate inside the native export; d14 set\n  LCG table; d15 set JNI hop. Unseen as v2 so far: d05, d08, d11, d12, d13, d18, d20, d21 -- expect each with its mechanic.\"\"\")\nrep(\"\"\"- **Puzzle schema (d23, d24)** -- v1 in the single, v2 `analysis` (no `data`, field `build`) in TT and in ALL Mastery\n  sets incl. old days (d23 7/7, d24 8/8).\"\"\",\"\"\"- **Puzzle schema (d23-d25)** -- v1 in the single, v2 `analysis` (no `data`, field `build`) in TT and in ALL Mastery\n  sets incl. old days (d23 7/7, d24 8/8, d25 9/9).\"\"\")\nrep(\"\"\"every time seen; `order[i]` = output slot of `parts[i]`.\"\"\",\"\"\"every time seen; `order[i]` = output slot of `parts[i]`. `hex` (d6/d12/d25) = ASCII hex of the answer.\"\"\")\nrep(\"\"\"- **Computed-chain shape (d23-d24, v2)** -- per build: class names (`Core`, `Guard`, `Mix`, `Util`, `Probe`, `Tab`,\n  theme-named `HookScan`/`TrampolineMap`/`SignalBank`/`TrustAnchor`, d24 `BoardCheck`/`SensorMap`), method names\n  `<verb><ThemeWord><2 hex>` (`mixPatcheb`, `scanAlibi87`, `finEmud6`), seed `const-wide`, mixer constants, probe kinds/args\n  (`s1: ((i*a+b)^c)&4095==d`, `s2: ((i^c)*a+b)&4095==d`, `s3`), the theme gate fn (`instrumentationSignals = (a^b^c)&7`\n  d23, `emulatorScore = (a+b+c)%4` d24, `gateStreamac = ((a*3)^b^c)&255` d14, `gateDomain87 = ((a^b)+c)&255` d10;\n  old-day sets `gateRelay*` d03, `gateVerify*` d09, `gateSplit*` d10), extras (d14 `Tab.build` LCG `long[16]` table walked 6 rounds; d15 `native long nativeShare(long)` in\n  `libarena.so`, pure add/xor/imul/rol arithmetic).\"\"\",\"\"\"- **Computed-chain shape (d23-d25, v2)** -- per build: class names (`Core`, `Guard`, `Mix`, `Util`, `Probe`, `Tab`,\n  theme-named `HookScan`/`TrampolineMap`/`SignalBank`/`TrustAnchor`, d24 `BoardCheck`/`SensorMap`, d25 `SealCheck`/\n  `VerdictMap`), method names `<verb><ThemeWord><2 hex>` (`mixPatcheb`, `scanAlibi87`, `finIntegrity9a`), seed\n  `const-wide`, mixer constants, probe kinds/args/COUNT (`s1: ((i*a+b)^c)&4095==d`, `s2: ((i^c)*a+b)&4095==d`, `s3`; 3\n  calls d23-d24, 2 calls d25; `Probe` defines only the kinds it uses), the theme gate fn and its SIGNATURE\n  (`(III)I`: `instrumentationSignals = (a^b^c)&7` d23, `emulatorScore = (a+b+c)%4` d24, `gateStreamac = ((a*3)^b^c)&255`\n  d14, `gateDomain87 = ((a^b)+c)&255` d10, `gateNativefa = ((a+b)^c)&255` d16, `gateRelay*` d03, `gateVerify*` d09;\n  `(JI)J`: d25 `integrityStatement(long a, int b) = a ^ (long)b`, result `long-to-int` before folding), extras (d14\n  `Tab.build` LCG `long[16]` walked 6 rounds; d15 `native long nativeShare(long)`; d16 `native long nativeShare(long, int\n  len)` = returns 0 unless `len > 0xffff && (u16)len == K` (dex passes a const that passes, e.g. 104414 -> 0x97DE), then\n  xor/shr/rol/add/imul; d19 `routeMaze*` = `\"m\" + ReflectionMaze.dispatch(k)` (packed-switch) -> `Class.forName(<pkg>.Maze)\n  .getDeclaredMethod(name, long.class).invoke(null, Long)` over 8 look-alike `Maze.m0..m7`).\"\"\")\nrep(\"\"\"- **Mastery set mix (d15+)** -- fixtures of DIFFERENT days (codec/schema, theme, package `dNN`, extra entries); JSON `day`\n  and dex `DAY` name the source day; picks re-roll per attempt; last set = today's (d24: d03 d06 d09 d10+NSC d15+.so d17\n  d23 d24).\"\"\",\"\"\"- **Mastery set mix (d15+)** -- fixtures of DIFFERENT days (codec/schema, theme, package `dNN`, extra entries); JSON `day`\n  and dex `DAY` name the source day; picks re-roll per attempt; last set = today's (d24: d03 d06 d09 d10+NSC d15+.so d17\n  d23 d24; d25: d01 d04 d07 d10+NSC d14 d16+.so d19 d22 d25 -- one old day per 3-day stride).\"\"\")\nrep(\"\"\"- **Mastery packaging** -- `delivery N: <name>_mastery_0N.apk` per set: pair by sha256. 3, 5, 6, 7 (d23), 8 (d24) sets,\"\"\",\"\"\"- **Mastery packaging** -- `delivery N: <name>_mastery_0N.apk` per set: pair by sha256. 3, 5, 6, 7 (d23), 8 (d24), 9 (d25) sets,\"\"\")\nrep(\"\"\"- **Native lib shape (d15-d16, d23-d15set)** -- d15 literal lib; d16 TT gate `nativeEvidence(int)`; d23 v2 d15 set: 13512 B\n  lib exporting only `Java_<pkg>_NativeLibrarySecrets_nativeShare` + `huntress_arena_day`, no `ANS-` literal. Never key on\n  export names or lib size.\"\"\",\"\"\"- **Native lib shape (d15-d16, d23-d25 v2 sets)** -- d15 literal lib; d16 TT gate `nativeEvidence(int)`; v2 d15 set: 13512 B\n  lib exporting only `Java_<pkg>_NativeLibrarySecrets_nativeShare` + `huntress_arena_day`; v2 d16 set (d25): 13648 B,\n  `nativeShare(JI)J` + `nativeEvidence` + `huntress_arena_length_accepts`, gate on the int arg. No `ANS-` literal in v2\n  libs. Never key on export names, arity or lib size: mangle the JNI name from the dex `native` method, emulate it.\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF","description":"Apply header and variant-axis edits"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":499,"cache_read_input_tokens":104798,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":499},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"42f33c12-3125-441c-8886-1e987da4999d","uuid":"8efd999b-14ba-4cfe-a900-893172c61831","timestamp":"2026-10-25T13:10:31.606Z","request_id":"req_011CgP1YkTxm9HELb3d3WrCg","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01UL3qqKcAUXLZxtcbMC4PSy":{"command":"cd /home/testpwn/huntress-2026; python3 - <<'EOF'\np='reference/techniques/mobile-android.md'\ns=open(p).read()\ndef rep(a,b):\n    global s\n    assert s.count(a)==1, a[:60]\n    s=s.replace(a,b)\nrep(\"technique log (days 1-24;\",\"technique log (days 1-25;\")\nrep(\"\"\"  `root_detection` d22, `hook_detection` \"hook and instrumentation detectio