lection` = plaintext; no reflection API in dex; TT strings `dispatch`/`STRUCTURAL`) |\",\n    \"| 43 | Reflection / `Class.forName` obfuscation | seen D19 (theme only), **D25 code-side** (Mastery v2 d19 set: `Class.forName(<pkg>.Maze).getDeclaredMethod(\\\"m\\\"+dispatch(k), long.class).invoke(null, Long)`; evaluator handled it) |\")\nrep(\"| high (mixed Mastery); code-side version still unseen |\\n| 44 |\",\"| high (mixed Mastery; next: getMethods() scan, Field.get, name from decrypted string) |\\n| 44 |\")\nrep(\"| 63 | Mixed-day Mastery bundle | seen D15-D23 (D22: 6 sets; D23: 7 sets, ALL regenerated as v2 `analysis`) |\",\n    \"| 63 | Mixed-day Mastery bundle | seen D15-D25 (D22: 6 sets; D23: 7, D24: 8, D25: 9 sets, ALL v2 `analysis`; D25 old-day sets carry their real mechanic as code) |\")\nrep(\"| 65 | JNI type/length mismatch (int -> u16/jshort narrowing, signed/unsigned, jsize vs strlen, jbyteArray NUL) | seen D16 |\",\n    \"| 65 | JNI type/length mismatch (int -> u16/jshort narrowing, signed/unsigned, jsize vs strlen, jbyteArray NUL) | seen D16, D25 (v2 d16 set: `nativeShare(long, int len)` returns 0 unless `len > 0xffff && (u16)len == K`; dex passes a passing const) |\")\nrep(\"| 37 | JNI `Java_*` / exported native secret | seen D15, D16, D23 (v2 d15 set: `native long nativeShare(long)` mid-chain, pure add/xor/imul/rol, no literal) |\",\n    \"| 37 | JNI `Java_*` / exported native secret | seen D15, D16, D23-D25 (v2 d15 set `nativeShare(long)`; D25 v2 d16 set `nativeShare(long,int)` gated; pure add/xor/imul/rol, no literal) |\")\nrep(\"| 77 | Reflective dispatch table (string-keyed `Map<String,Method>`, string `switch` -> `hashCode()` lookupswitch, key from deep link/extra/asset) | gap (D19 title/prompt; TT string `dispatch`) |\",\n    \"| 77 | Reflective dispatch table (string-keyed `Map<String,Method>`, string `switch` -> `hashCode()` lookupswitch, key from deep link/extra/asset) | seen D25 (v2 d19 set: int key const -> `dispatch(int)` packed-switch ->